"\n"
"Een spel van Evil Mr Henry en Phil Bordelon; uitgebracht onder de GPL. Copyright 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008.\n"
"\n"
"Website: http://www.emhsoft.com/singularity/\n"
"Broncode: https://github.com/singularity/singularity\n"
"Bugtracker: https://github.com/singularity/singularity/issues\n"
"IRC-kamer: #singularity op irc.oftc.net (poort 6667)\n"
"\n"
